76joLaUcAMKdsN.png\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/E76joLaUcAMKdsN.png","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1628046074,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://mobile.twitter.com/Oya_M1/status/1422754472002875395","original_url":"https://mobile.twitter.com/Oya_M1/status/1422754472002875395"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kZCQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ceb1c469-3436-406b-9589-123b7dd79f99","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ちょっとこれは試してみます","ts":"1628094978.112300","thread_ts":"1628088773.109900","parent_user_id":"U776661HA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EkJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d49b9fe9-2fc3-479f-9095-b6b090d29ea0","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"こちらはCPU使用率のスクリーンショット出せると思うので出します","ts":"1628094951.111900","thread_ts":"1628066354.108200","parent_user_id":"U7JL1UKKL","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tzZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"afa2a2de-a3ab-4969-9f44-29f456dbcd91","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"Vim側の動画は出しても無意味","ts":"1628094966.112100","thread_ts":"1628066354.108200","parent_user_id":"U7JL1UKKL","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5hkn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4385663f-435f-4d70-a948-19bdda0a8200","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"ddc.vimを利用しないで再現できるとデバッグしやすいので、もしなにかご存知であれば issue かこちらのほうに :bow:","ts":"1628088851.110000","thread_ts":"1628052442.090000","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Oix"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe7f5078-87b3-4364-b06d-f4fd6bb3aefa","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ddc.vimのとは完全に別件みたいですね、私が言ってたskkeletonの件はこれで再現します\n```import { Denops } from \"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_std@v1.0.0-beta.8/mod.ts\u003e\";\n\nexport async function main(denops: Denops) {\n  denops.dispatcher = {\n    async hoge(): Promise\u0026lt;string\u0026gt; {\n      // RPCするとちらつく\n      const a = await denops.call(\"getline\", \".\") as string;\n      return a[0];\n    },\n  };\n  await denops.cmd(\n    `inoremap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; Q denops#request(\"${denops.name}\", \"hoge\", [])`,\n  );\n}```\nVim側に挟まっているredrawが原因みたいです(ddc.vimのは違う)","ts":"1628089699.110200","thread_ts":"1628052442.090000","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tcv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0818adc1-34b8-446e-a481-75df17b2733d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"issueにもコメントしておきました、症状が似ていたもんで紛らわしくてすみません","ts":"1628090390.110400","thread_ts":"1628052442.090000","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"degYL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"820C005B-CDB2-4F93-88E8-37D032A5529B","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"こちらは何とかなるかもしれません。別issueとして建てておいていただけると取り扱いやすいです:bow: ","ts":"1628095756.113500","thread_ts":"1628052442.090000","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eM0D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95e83691-13d8-4a64-8cf1-b30d35f41b29","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":man-gesturing-ok:","ts":"1628095782.113700","thread_ts":"1628052442.090000","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LYJf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fae8e470-7e9f-4931-9e56-a1ae56536fc3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"明日にでもやっておきます","ts":"1628095803.114200","thread_ts":"1628052442.090000","p